<h2 id="shipping">Shipping</h2>
<p>We pack every order by hand, in a recyclable box with paper filling. Washes travel with a sealed pump so nothing leaks on the way.</p>
<h3>Where we ship and how long it takes</h3>
<p>The countries we ship to, the delivery options and an estimate for your address are shown at checkout, before you pay. If your country isn't listed, write to us before you order and we'll tell you whether we can help.</p>
<h3>What shipping costs</h3>
<div class="s-policy__table"><table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Order total</th><th scope="col">Shipping</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><td>$40 or more</td><td>Free</td></tr><tr><td>Under $40</td><td>Calculated at checkout for your address and the option you choose</td></tr></tbody>
</table></div>
<p>Taxes and any import charges depend on the destination. Where we can, checkout shows them before you pay.</p>
<h3>Tracking, changes and lost parcels</h3>
<ul>
<li>Your shipping confirmation email has a tracking link once the parcel leaves us.</li>
<li>Need to change the address or an item? Write to us with your order number as soon as you can. We can usually change an order until it has been packed.</li>
<li>If tracking hasn't moved for a while, or the parcel arrives damaged, send us your order number and a photo. We'll send a replacement or refund the missing items.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="returns">Returns and refunds</h2>
<p>Skin that reacts easily needs room to try things. That's why our first promise is about your skin, not the packaging.</p>
<h3>If your skin reacts</h3>
<p>Stop using the product. We refund your first bottle of any formula within 30 days of delivery, used or not. Send your order number and a photo of the label through <a href="{{ help_url }}">customer care</a>. You don't need to send the bottle back.</p>
<h3>Returning something for another reason</h3>
<p>Contact us with your order number and the item before you send anything. We'll explain the options for that item and give you the return address. Please don't post items back without hearing from us first, so we can match the parcel to your order.</p>
<div class="s-policy__table"><table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Situation</th><th scope="col">What we do</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Your skin reacted to your first bottle of a formula</td><td>Refund the bottle within 30 days of delivery, used or not, without a return</td></tr>
<tr><td>The parcel arrived damaged or an item is missing</td><td>Replace the item or refund it, your choice</td></tr>
<tr><td>You changed your mind</td><td>Contact us first and we'll explain the options for that item</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h3>How refunds are paid</h3>
<p>Refunds go back to the payment method you used, and we email you when we send them. How soon the money shows depends on your bank or card provider.</p>
<h2 id="privacy">Privacy</h2>
<p>We ask only for what we need to send your order, answer your questions and, if you want them, send you emails.</p>
<h3>What we collect</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Your order:</strong> name, delivery and billing address, email, phone number if you give one, and what you bought.</li>
<li><strong>What you tell us:</strong> messages to customer care, your skin type and reviews you send us.</li>
<li><strong>How you use the site:</strong> pages viewed and items saved or added to your bag, through cookies you accept in the cookie bar.</li>
</ul>
<p>Payments are handled by our payment providers. We never see or keep your full card number.</p>
<h3>Who we share it with</h3>
<p>Only the services that run the shop for us: our store platform, payment providers, the carriers who deliver your parcel and our email service. They may use your details only to do that work. We don't sell your personal information.</p>
<h3>Emails and cookies</h3>
<p>We send marketing emails only if you sign up, and every email has an unsubscribe link. You can change your cookie choice at any time from the cookie bar link at the bottom of each page.</p>
<h3>Your choices</h3>
<p>You can ask us for a copy of the details we hold about you, ask us to correct them, or ask us to delete them, unless we have to keep them, for example for tax records. Write to <a href="{{ help_url }}">customer care</a> and we'll reply by email.</p>
<h2 id="terms">Terms</h2>
<p>These terms cover your use of this site and the orders you place on it. By placing an order, you agree to them.</p>
<h3>Our products and your skin</h3>
<p>Our washes and lotions are for everyday care of dry and sensitive skin. They aren't medicines, and nothing on this site is medical advice. Read the full ingredient list before use, try a small area first if your skin is reactive, and ask a doctor before using any product on broken skin or on a baby under one year old.</p>
<h3>Prices and orders</h3>
<ul>
<li>Prices are shown in your currency at checkout and include any taxes stated there.</li>
<li>Your order is accepted when we email you that it has shipped. If an item turns out to be unavailable or was priced wrongly, we'll tell you before it ships and refund anything you paid for it.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Subscriptions</h3>
<p>With subscribe and save, we send the products you chose on the schedule you chose, at the price shown when you subscribed. You can skip, change or cancel a delivery from your account before it is prepared.</p>
<h3>Reviews you send us</h3>
<p>We read every review before it appears. We publish your first name and the initial of your last name, never your email. We may shorten a review for length but never change its meaning, and we don't publish reviews that include health claims about someone else, personal details or offensive language.</p>
<h3>Changes to these policies</h3>
<p>If we change these policies, we update the date at the top of this page. The version on the page when you place an order is the one that applies to it.</p>
